    "title": "'The Perfect Neighbor' could win an Oscar. How to watch, what to know",
    "text": "March 15, 2026, 6:00 a.m. ETThe 98th annual Academy Awards will air live on Sunday, March 15, 2026, on ABC and Hulu.Conan O'Brien is set to return as the host for the second consecutive year.A Netflix documentary, \"The Perfect Neighbor,\" is nominated for \"Documentary Feature Film.\"The documentary covers the fatal 2023 shooting of Ajike \"AJ\" Owens by her neighbor, Susan Lorincz, in Ocala, Florida.The last major awards show of the 2026 award season is coming up this weekend. The 98th annual Academy Awards will air live this Sunday, March 15.And there is a Netflix documentary about a fatal shooting in Ocala, Florida, up for the \"Documentary Feature Film\" Oscar.Here's when and how to watch The Oscars and what to know about Netflix's \"The Perfect Neighbor\" documentary.When are The Oscars? How to watch the Academy AwardsThe 98th annual Academy Awards ceremony will be at 7 p.m. ET Sunday, March 15, 2026. You can watch the awards ceremony live on ABC with your live TV provider and on Hulu.Watch The Oscars 2026 with the Disney BundleWhen were the Oscar nominations announced?Nominations for the 98th annual Academy Awards were announced Thursday, Jan. 22. Who is going to host the Oscars in 2026?TV host, comedian, writer and producer Conan O'Brien will return for the second year in a row as the host of The Oscars.Florida connection to The Oscars 2026, 'The Perfect Neighbor' documentary nominatedFlorida has a strong connection at the 2026 Academy Awards, and it isn't an actor or actress. \"The Perfect Neighbor,\" a Netflix documentary about a fatal dispute between two Ocala neighbors, is nominated for the \"Documentary Feature Film\" Academy Award.The Netflix documentary about the infamous shooting death in Florida garnered a whopping 16.7 million views in the first three days after being released in October 2025. \"The Perfect Neighbor\" tells the story of Ocala resident Susan Lorincz, 61, who was convicted of manslaughter after shooting and killing her neighbor, Ajike \"AJ\" Shantrell Owens in 2023.What is 'The Perfect Neighbor' about?Lorincz was 58 years old at the time of the incident, fatally shooting Owens through a locked front door in front of her son. Owens was a 35-year-old mother of four in Ocala and a neighbor of Lorincz.The documentary showcases a timeline of the neighbors' feud through deputy bodycam footage, police interviews and 911 calls, resulting in the fatal incident on June 2, 2023. According to Netflix, the documentary is about \"fear, prejudice and Stand Your Ground laws.\"A jury found Lorincz, now 61, guilty of manslaughter with a firearm in August 2024. While sentencing guidelines called for a prison term of 11.5 to 30 years, one of Lorincz's lawyers filed a motion asking the judge to depart downward from those guidelines.After an emotional sentencing hearing in November 2024, a judge sentenced Lorincz to 25 years in prison.In a GoFundMe bio from 2023, family members describe Owens as someone who \"affected all she came into contact with her infectious personality, who had a smile that would light up the room.\" According to the documentary, law enforcement and witnesses, the feud between Owens and Lorincz was well-documented before the June 2023 shooting.Marion County Sheriff Billy Woods said during a news conference that deputies had responded over 10 times since January 2021 for a “neighborhood feud” between Owens and Lorincz.An incident report previously released by the sheriff’s office showed incidents, such as when Lorincz called deputies in February 2022, reporting that Owens was on her property with a dog and had thrown a “no trespassing” sign at her. She said the sign hit her left shin and caused a red mark, though deputies did not see any visible injuries.The documentary provides footage of this call, as well as several others. Multiple witnesses told officers during these incidents that Lorincz was known for \"messing with everyone's kids\" and causing trouble with neighbors.Where can I watch 'The Perfect Neighbor' documentary?Netflix's \"The Perfect Neighbor\" is an hour-and-a-half-long documentary. It is exclusively on Netflix. The streaming platform's subscription prices include: The ad-supported tier is at $7.99 per month, up from $6.99. The standard ad-free tier is $17.99 per month, up from $15.49. The premium tier is at $24.99 per month, up from $22.99Lianna Norman and Samantha Neely are trending reporters for the USA TODAY NETWORK-Florida, covering pop culture, Florida wildlife, breaking news and more. You can get all of Florida’s best content directly in your inbox each weekday by signing up for the free newsletter, Florida TODAY, at https://floridatoday.com/newsletters.",
